description=0.1.0-rc.8-perf.8 supports the exact audited Cooling Upgrades perf.1/perf.2/perf.3/perf.4/perf.5/perf.6/perf.7/perf.8 versions with existing write scopes and hook checks. / 精确适配冷藏升级perf.1／perf.2／perf.3／perf.4／perf.5／perf.6／perf.7／perf.8，保留餐盒写入作用域及调用链校验。 Retains rc.8, which raises the regular bottom attachment toward the Legendary Backpack base and retains fixes for B42.21 vehicle Set iteration, attached model registration and long item tooltips; retains the single-player backpack-bottom attachment candidate. Uses an existing normal, large or ALICE bedroll/tent slot, shared with its original item; no extra slots or backpack dependency. A dedicated attached model reuses the current lunchbox mesh and texture. Attached lunchboxes keep a container button and freshness restoration; ordinary Container Upgrades 1.0.3 requires detaching and emptying before upgrades or restoration. Retains either-hand carrying, food-only storage, starting capacity 4, weight 1, weight reduction 50%, sandbox settings, paid upgrade records and the rc.5 ground outline. Existing item IDs and food are retained. Offline candidate only; attachment positioning, animations, Viewpoint and save/reload require user acceptance.
